OL,3,GNEWSAFamily speaks out after
OL,4,Alife-changing pub attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a man left with a
OL,7,Flife-changing brain injury after an
OL,8,Funprovoked attack during a night out in
OL,9,FLeicestershire have said a "senseless
OL,10,Fact of violence" changed their lives
OL,11,Fforever.
OL,13,FAlistair Roome, 47, was headbutted
OL,14,Foutside a pub in Belvoir Road,
OL,15,FCoalville, in April and remains in a
OL,16,Fspecialist brain injury rehabilitation
OL,17,Funit five months later.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,364,360,200,160,0,100
