OL,3,GNEWSAFamily speaks out after
OL,4,Alife-changing pub attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FKyle Morrissey, 35, of Prestop Drive,
OL,7,FAshby-de-la-Zouch, was sentenced to two
OL,8,Fyears in prison at Leicester Crown
OL,9,FCourt on Friday after pleading guilty
OL,10,Fto inflicting grievous bodily harm
OL,11,Fwithout intent.
OL,13,FIn a statement, Roome's family members
OL,14,Fsaid the attack had changed their lives
OL,15,Fforever.
